.TH CRS-REMOTE 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-controlroom-setup 1.0.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
crs\-remote \- run control\-room VNC and installation commands on the DAQ hosts over ssh
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B crs\-remote
.BR start | stop | status | install | provision
.RB [ \-\-session
.IR NAME " |"
.B \-\-host
.IR H " |"
.BR \-\-all ]
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR FILE ]
.RB [ \-\-ssh\-config
.IR FILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
For each selected session,
.B crs\-remote
runs
.PP
.EX
ssh \-o GSSAPIAuthentication=yes \-o GSSAPIDelegateCredentials=yes \e
    \-J GATEWAY \-o BatchMode=yes ACCOUNT@HOST 'COMMAND'
.EE
.PP
logging in as the session's shared
.B account
\(em not
.BR personal_user ,
unlike
.BR crs\-tunnel (1).
The operator's Kerberos principal must therefore be accepted by each
shared account (its
.IR .k5login ).
Commit da08771 recorded that the VNC accounts on mu2e\-mgr\-01 refused it.
Remote output is printed with an
.BI [ account @ shorthost ]
prefix; remote stderr is printed only for a failing command.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B start
.B ~/controlroom/bin/start\-vnc\-session.sh
.I NAME DISPLAY
.B \-g
.I GEOMETRY
.B \-d
.IR DEPTH .
.TP
.B stop
.B ~/controlroom/bin/stop\-vnc\-session.sh
.I NAME
.IR DISPLAY .
.TP
.B status
.B ~/controlroom/bin/status\-vnc\-session.sh
.I NAME
.IR DISPLAY ;
selects
.B \-\-all
when no target is given.
.TP
.B install
Streams a gzip tar of
.I server/
plus
.I config/controlroom.yaml
and
.I config/apps.yaml
over the ssh channel into
.IR ~/.crs\-payload ,
runs
.BR install\-controlroom.sh (1)
there and deletes the payload.
Runs once per distinct (host, account) pair.
.TP
.B provision
.B ~/controlroom/bin/crs\-provision\-desktop \-\-session
.IR NAME .
.PP
The remote paths are fixed at
.IR ~/controlroom/bin ;
the
.B install_dir
setting and
.B CRS_INSTALL_DIR
are read but not used.
.SH OPTIONS
As
.BR crs\-tunnel (1),
without
.BR \-\-viewer .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I config/controlroom.yaml
sessions and gateway.
.TP
.I config/apps.yaml
shipped by
.BR install .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.BR CRS_CONFIG ,
.BR CRS_GATEWAY ,
as in
.BR crs\-tunnel (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 if every remote command exited 0; 1 if any failed, on a configuration
or selection error, or with no Kerberos ticket; 2 on a command\-line
error.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
crs\-remote install \-\-all
crs\-remote provision \-\-session shift\-main
crs\-remote start \-\-session dcs\-main
crs\-remote status
crs\-remote stop \-\-host mu2e\-mgr\-01
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR crs\-tunnel (1),
.BR crs\-gui (1),
.BR start\-vnc\-session.sh (1),
.BR install\-controlroom.sh (1),
.BR crs\-provision\-desktop (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group.
